/**
 * Caret — placeholder atom
 *
 * EXTRACTED 2026-05-14 from FormField as part of validator audit.
 *
 * This atom owns the CSS for the custom text caret + arrow-tab indicator.
 * It has NO server-rendered markup — the caret <span> is injected at
 * runtime by src/lib/caret/custom-caret.ts when an input gains focus.
 *
 * Caret.astro exists so the schema/renderer pipeline has a target file.
 * Rendering it on a page is a no-op. The pipeline routes nothing here;
 * the JS owns DOM creation and the CSS owns presentation.
 *
 * Activation: data-custom-caret on <html>.
 *
 * Future cleanup (deferred):
 *   - rename .form-field__caret → .caret in CSS + JS string literals
 *   - rename .form-field__arrow-tab → .caret__arrow
 *   - decouple measurer creation from inline JS styles
 *   - add a proper .astro template if/when caret gains static markup
 *     (e.g. a server-rendered "first focus me" hint)
 */
---
{/* No markup. See module docs above. */}
